d:<\/strong> Meets European safety standards for protective equipment. Designed for compliance with regulations across European leagues and recreational play.<br\/><\/p><p><strong>Approved for play in the NHL:<\/strong> <a href=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0635\/2401\/2210\/files\/NHL_Titan_Battlegear_Base_Layer_Top_with_Cut_Resistant_Neck_and_Wrist_Protection-July_10_2025.pdf?v=1752276441\">Download Certificate<\/a><\/p>","page":"","body_size":"body3","media_type":"image","image_width":100}},"collapsible_row_3":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"title":"Fabric & technology","heading_size":"caption1","icon_type":"none","icon":"shield","icon_size":24,"text":"<ul><li>Body and Sleeve: 87% Poly %13 Lycra, 4.16 oz<\/li><li>Back Mesh: 90% 10% Lycra, 3.24 oz<\/li><li>Fit: Fitted Athletic Fit<\/li><li>ARC~GUARD™ Contoured Collar<\/li><li>TITANOTEX™ cut-resistant neck guard<\/li><li>TITANOTEX™ cut-resistant bib<\/li><li>TITANOTEX™ cut-resistant wrist guards<\/li><li>4-Way Stretch<\/li><li>Quick Dry Technology<\/li><li>Thermo-Regulated<\/li><li>Mesh Back & Underarm Panel<\/li><li>Anti-Bacterial<\/li><li>Oeko-Tex Certified (<a href=\"https:\/\/www.oeko-tex.com\/en\/our-standards\/oeko-tex-standard-100#:~:text=OEKO%2DTEX%C2%AE%20STANDARD%20100%20is%20a%20label%20for%20textiles,the%20presence%20of%20harmful%20substances\" target=\"_blank\">learn more<\/a>)<\/li><\/ul>","page":"","body_size":"body3","media_type":"image","image_width":100}},"collapsible_row_fH78LR":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"title":"Praduct Disclamer","heading_size":"caption1","icon_type":"none","icon":"information","icon_size":24,"text":"<p>Products offering “cut resistance” and “cut protection” do not 100% prevent or eliminate cut injuries or lacerations, especially against powered blades or sharp equipment.<br\/><br\/>The information provided by Titan Battlegear is based on current knowledge and is intended as guidance for your decisions or product selections.<br\/><br\/>Titan Battlegear’s cut protection products are highly resistant to cuts, but they are not completely cut-proof. Nothing is 100% cut-proof under all conditions.<br\/><br\/>The Battlegear collection provides a very high level of protection, but caution is advised during use. Despite their high resistance to cuts, there is always a possibility that objects could penetrate these products under certain circumstances.<\/p>","page":"","body_size":"body3","media_type":"image","image_width":100}},"collapsible_row_bjtQdb":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"title":"CARE INSTRUCTIONS","heading_size":"caption1","icon_type":"none","icon":"list","icon_size":24,"text":"<ul><li>Hand or Machine Wash, Cold<\/li><li>Line or Tumble Dry, No Heat<\/li><li>No Bleach<\/li><li>Do Not Iron or Dry Clean<\/li><\/ul>","page":"","body_size":"body3","media_type":"image","image_width":100}},"collapsible_row_1":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"title":"Shipping","heading_size":"caption2","icon_type":"none","icon":"shipping-box","icon_size":24,"text":"","page":"","body_size":"body3","media_type":"image","image_width":100}},"38be3ebc-485c-45e7-9927-85db51744fe3":{"type":"collapsible_row","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"RETURNS & EXCHANGES","heading_size":"caption3","icon_type":"none","icon":"easy-returns","icon_size":24,"text":"<p>Pair image with text to tell more about your product: care instructions, country of origin, manufacturer information, matching colors and accessories.<\/p>","page":"","body_size":"body3","media_type":"image","image_width":100}},"ac8e1a5b-196f-494d-ba25-cc0875524e4f":{"type":"collapsible_row","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"FIND YOUR SIZE","heading_size":"caption3","icon_type":"none","icon":"routing","icon_size":24,"text":"<p>Pair image with text to tell more about your product: care instructions, country of origin, manufacturer information, matching colors and accessories.<\/p>","page":"","body_size":"body3","media_type":"image","image_width":100}},"01f519e2-da9a-4fa